.TH PKMN 1 "August 2026" "pkmn 3.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pkmn \- translate Pokemon Red or Blue saves into FireRed or LeafGreen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pkmn
.I domain command
[arguments] [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pkmn
provides four-route Red/Blue to FireRed/LeafGreen conversion plus decoding, inspection, validation, canonical JSON, generation, archival reconstruction, comparison, proof, and copy-first editing. Downloaded packages need no separate Python, CMake, Git, compiler, or ROM.
.SH CONVERSION
.TP
.B pkmn red convert game.sav [--auto-repair-checksum] [--write-repaired-source COPY] [--output game_fr.sav] [--template clean-fr.sav]
Validate and convert a Pokemon Red save. The default output is game_fr.sav.
.TP
.B pkmn rjson convert game.red.json [--output game_fr.sav] [--template clean-fr.sav]
Convert canonical Red JSON directly to a FireRed save.
.TP
.B pkmn rjson convert_to_frjson game.red.json [--output game.fred.json]
Translate Red semantics into FireRed JSON without writing a physical save.
.TP
.B pkmn convert red-firered RED [--preview|--plan-only] [--output-json FILE|--output-save SAVE]
Use the unified converter with preview, plan-only, policy, manifest, and output controls.
.TP
.B pkmn convert red-leafgreen|blue-firered|blue-leafgreen SAVE
Run one of the three statically validated community-testing routes. Red to FireRed remains emulator verified.
.TP
.B pkmn convert routes [--format json]
List typed game profiles, route capabilities, and verification evidence.
.TP
.B pkmn convert inspect|explain event|trainer|item [QUERY]
Inspect source-backed bridge decisions.
.PP
A validated clean FireRed template is bundled and selected automatically.
Use --template or PKMN_FIRERED_TEMPLATE to select a strictly validated custom clean dump.
.SH GENERAL COMMANDS
.TP
.B pkmn interactive
Open the beginner guided workflow for all four Red/Blue to FireRed/LeafGreen routes.
.TP
.B pkmn --help
Show available and reserved commands.
.TP
.B pkmn --version
Show the CLI version.
.TP
.B pkmn doctor [--deep] [--format text|json]
Report standalone internal-engine readiness.
.TP
.B pkmn completion bash|zsh|fish
Generate shell completion source.
.TP
.B pkmn config show [--format text|json]
Show immutable compiled safety and default policy.
.TP
.B pkmn get-all-cmds [--format text|json|markdown] [--output FILE]
Show or save the complete command catalog compiled into this version.
.SH RED COMMANDS
.TP
.B pkmn red summary SAVE [--format text|json|markdown] [--output FILE]
Summarize trainer progress, party, inventory, storage, and supported world state.
.TP
.B pkmn red inspect|validate SAVE [--format json]
Inspect or validate Red SRAM and all known checksums.
.TP
.B pkmn red decode SAVE [--output FILE] [--include-physical-image|--no-physical-image]
Write deterministic canonical Red JSON without overwriting existing output.
.TP
.B pkmn red edit SAVE
Run the interactive copy-first editor.
.TP
.B pkmn red begin-edit|edit-session|pokemon|bag|progress|pending-edits|validate-edit|end-edit ...
Run durable scriptable edit sessions.
.TP
.B pkmn red validate-post-emulator BEFORE AFTER
Validate and classify a manual emulator round trip.
.TP
.B pkmn red repair-checksums SAVE [--output COPY]
Write a checksum-repaired copy and report without changing SAVE.
.TP
.B pkmn red events list|search|show ...
Discover the verified named-event catalog.
.TP
.B pkmn red validate-batch|decode-batch ...
Run multi-save validation or transactional decoding.
.SH RED JSON COMMANDS
.TP
.B pkmn rjson inspect|validate FILE [--format json] [--profile PROFILE]
Validate canonical schema, semantics, and optional physical image.
.TP
.B pkmn rjson generate FILE [OUTPUT]
Generate a deterministic semantic save without using physicalImage authority.
.TP
.B pkmn rjson reconstruct FILE [--output OUTPUT]
Perform exact archival reconstruction requiring physicalImage.
.TP
.B pkmn rjson migrate FILE | pkmn rjson schema | pkmn rjson generate-batch ...
Enrich compatible canonical documents or generate several transactionally.
.SH FIRERED COMMANDS
.TP
.B pkmn fred summary|inspect|validate|decode SAVE ...
Summarize, inspect, validate, or decode a FireRed save using the native engine.
.TP
.B pkmn fred edit SAVE [--output COPY] [safe edits]
Apply narrow copy-first FireRed edits.
.TP
.B pkmn fred repair-checksums|validate-batch|decode-batch|validate-post-emulator ...
Run copy-first repair, batch automation, and emulator-round-trip validation.
.TP
.B pkmn fred begin-edit|edit-session|pending-edits|undo-edit|edit-history|annotate-edit|validate-edit|end-edit ...
Run safe persistent FireRed edit sessions.
.TP
.B pkmn fred events list|search|show ...
Discover pinned pret FireRed flag, variable, trainer, and semantic-event records.
.TP
.B pkmn frjson inspect|validate|schema|update_schema ...
Inspect and maintain native or planned FireRed JSON.
.TP
.B pkmn frjson generate FILE [OUTPUT] [--template SAVE]
Generate from accepted planned or complete native schema 0.4.0 FireRed JSON without physicalImage authority. Native generation passed Phase 5.
.TP
.B pkmn frjson reconstruct FILE [--output SAVE]
Perform archival reconstruction from a native JSON physicalImage.
.SH COMPARISON AND PROOF
.TP
.B pkmn compare progress OLDER NEWER
Explain gameplay changes between two valid backups from the same playthrough.
.TP
.B pkmn compare physical A B
Compare save bytes, hashes, percentages, and regions.
.TP
.B pkmn compare semantic A B
Classify field-aware canonical semantic differences.
.TP
.B pkmn compare firered-semantic|firered-progress|firered-pokemon|firered-events|firered-trainers|firered-items|firered-fly|firered-hall-of-fame A B
Run complete or focused FireRed comparisons.
.TP
.B pkmn compare bridge RED_JSON FRED_JSON [--manifest FILE]
Audit the cross-generation semantic boundary.
.TP
.B pkmn proof red SAVE [--output-dir DIR] [--zip|--zip-output ZIP]
Run decode, generation, re-decode, comparison, determinism, isolation, report, and emulator-checklist workflows.
.TP
.B pkmn proof post-emulator --before SAVE --after SAVE [--proof-dir DIR]
Complete the manual emulator proof gate after validating expected drift.
.TP
.B pkmn proof verify DIRECTORY|ZIP
Verify proof artifact hashes, ZIP safety, JSON, and generated checksums.
.TP
.B pkmn proof fred FRED_JSON [--template SAVE]
Build the automated Phase 5 deterministic and physical-image-isolation package.
.TP
.B pkmn proof red-to-firered RED_JSON [--template SAVE]
Build the automated Phase 6 conversion package and MAQ checklist.
.SH SAFETY
Inputs and existing outputs are not overwritten. Semantic generation never uses physicalImage as authority. Reconstruction is explicitly archival. Arbitrary runtime location editing is disabled. Proof packages contain save data and require publication review.
.PP
Commands that create outputs accept explicit --auto-suffix where documented, producing numbered alternatives without weakening the no-overwrite default.
.SH VERIFICATION GATES
FireRed and Red-to-FireRed commands are implemented. Native schema 0.4.0
generation passed Phase 5. A clean FireRed template is bundled. The supported Red-to-FireRed conversion policy passed
Phase 6; per-save warnings and policy decisions remain explicit.
